obj/
cxx1.exe
tests/out-*/
.DS_Store
# **macOS makes a duplicate beside a file it has just rewritten**, so a clean
# build leaves `cxx1 2.exe` next to `cxx1.exe`. Harmless here - the Makefiles
# filter on src/%.cpp and verify-three's tar excludes *.exe - but it has
# broken a build in a neighbouring tree, so it is named rather than deleted by
# hand each time. See CLAUDE.md on building inside ~/Documents.
cxx1 *.exe
obj-msvc/
cxx1-msvc.exe
